      "widgets_values": [
        1,
        "Ultra Anime",
        false,
        "A woman from Argentina, with full, red lips and a smile, is perched on the shoulder of a tall and powerfully built polar bear. They are in a vibrant, slightly blurry, nighttime club scene. Directly above them, a large retro neon sign glows with the words \"Total Fun!!!\" in thick, hand-drawn retro letters made of pink and gold neon tubes, framed by a slightly dented metal border, its glow flickering warmly against the dark ceiling like a heartbeat of light. She is clad in a pink, bulky, industrial-style mecha armor, made of metal and covering her body, and in her hands, she holds a huge black gun. The polar bear is wearing identical mecha armor, but in black, also made of metal and covering its body. The polar bear is holding her securely on his shoulder with one massive paw, and its other arm is raised high in the air, waving as if celebrating. Its eyes are directly facing the camera with a wide, cheerful grin spreading across its face. The setting is a crowded nightclub with people in the background, clusters of shiny metallic and multicolored balloons bobbing gently among the crowd, surrounded by smoke, and colorful lights flashing everywhere. The atmosphere is lively, with the woman and the polar bear seemingly lost in the music, moving in sync as if dancing together, their mecha armor glistening under the flashing lights.",
